# the class names. An Action holds the robot's steps (go to, pick up, and
# the rest). If and Else are nodes on the sketch, the flowchart, and in
# JSON. The custom prompt does not author them. Save hands the class to
# the task manager. The next run reads it from memory, so a save applies
# while the app is open. Nothing here changes the planner. The planner
# still receives one task string.


